      "role": "user",
      "content": "the small stuff doesn't even matter anymore. like, saving a few bucks on groceries isn't gonna fix the fact that the math literally doesn't work. i look at my bank account and my bills and i just see a hole that's getting deeper every single month. it feels less like a \"challenge\" and more like a mathematical certainty that i'm just gonna drown eventually. it's like the system is designed so that people like me just... fade out.",
